# Runtime data written next to the exe when running from source: the driver
# store's default download/backup folder (app/drivers/folder.py).
# Leading slash: anchored to the repo root. Unanchored, Windows' case-insensitive
# matching also ignored app/drivers/ and silently dropped its modules.
/Drivers/

# Raw capture output from a local visual pass; regenerated on demand and not
# committed. The curated README screenshots in screenshots/ ARE versioned:
# the README embeds all eight, so a renamed or missing file is a broken
# image on GitHub (which is case-sensitive; keep the names lowercase).
shots/
